# Candidate zip denylist. `git archive` honours `export-ignore`, so these paths never reach a
# candidate. Everything else ships by default: when adding an internal-only path, add it here.
# Rules are anchored with a leading slash on purpose: an unanchored `tests/` would also strip every
# exercise's own `tests/` folder from the candidate zip.
# tools/exercises.py `check` fails if the core entries below disappear; `build` re-derives this
# list and fails if any of it leaked into the zip.

/manifests/ export-ignore
/tools/ export-ignore
/tests/ export-ignore
/.specs/ export-ignore
/.answer-keys/ export-ignore
/src/reference/ export-ignore
/.github/ export-ignore
/.claude/ export-ignore
/CLAUDE.md export-ignore
/.gitattributes export-ignore
